          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಉಸ್ತುವಾರಿ — ustuvāri — \"oversight; charge\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೊಸ ಕಟ್ಟಡದ ಕೆಲಸದ ಉಸ್ತುವಾರಿ ನನ್ನ ಅಣ್ಣನದು. hosa kaṭṭaḍada kelasada ustuvāri nanna aṇṇanadu. My elder brother is in charge of the new building work."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಉಸ್ತುವಾರಿ (ustuvāri) ವಹಿಸು, to take charge."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಉಸ್ತುವಾರಿ (ustuvāri) came into Kannada with the language of offices; its source is not settled."
            }
          ]
