          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಒತ್ತಾಯಿಸು — ottāyisu — \"to insist; to urge\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಊಟ ಮಾಡಿಕೊಂಡು ಹೋಗು ಅಂತ ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಒತ್ತಾಯಿಸಿದರು. ūṭa māḍikoṇḍu hōgu anta ajji ottāyisidaru. Grandmother insisted that I eat before going."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಒತ್ತಾಯಿಸಿದೆ, ottāyiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The one urged takes -ಅನ್ನು; ಒತ್ತಾಯ is pressure, insistence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಒತ್ತಾಯಿಸು (ottāyisu) is usually traced to the native verb ottu, \"to press, push\" (DEDR 1021): to put pressure on someone. The middle part is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
