              "text": "ಅವಳ ಯಶಸ್ಸಿಗೆ ಅವಳ ಪರಿಶ್ರಮವೇ ಕಾರಣ. avaḷa yaśassige avaḷa pariśramavē kāraṇa. Her hard work is the reason for her success."
            },
